00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:09.980
as well as
integration with Cloud

00:10:09.980 --> 00:10:12.350
and on-prem management tools.

00:10:12.350 --> 00:10:16.700
For your business, the
platform is secure by design.

00:10:16.700 --> 00:10:19.520
The platform leverages
comprehensive, AI-driven threat

00:10:19.520 --> 00:10:22.610
detection and granular
policies to protect

00:10:22.610 --> 00:10:26.690
your data and your
users, custom security

00:10:26.690 --> 00:10:29.630
protocols for individuals
or groups of users,

00:10:29.630 --> 00:10:33.890
and you can easily provision,
manage, and secure devices.

00:10:33.890 --> 00:10:38.090
Lost or stolen devices can
be disabled within minutes.

00:10:38.090 --> 00:10:40.190
With over 200
security policies that

00:10:40.190 --> 00:10:43.700
may be applied to either
the user or the device,

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:47.030
granular and flexible controls
enable centralized fleet

00:10:47.030 --> 00:10:49.160
management and updates.

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:51.170
This ensures compliance
of IT policies,

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:54.050
no matter which user
is accessing the device

00:10:54.050 --> 00:10:59.090
or which device is being
accessed by the end user.

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:02.320
This drives value for
your organization.

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:03.880
Increase your
employees' productivity

00:11:03.880 --> 00:11:07.810
by ensuring they spend less
time waiting for new updates.

00:11:07.810 --> 00:11:10.330
Automatic managed updates
take place in the background

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:12.300
without getting in the way.

00:11:12.300 --> 00:11:14.710
And without those distractions
that sometimes you

00:11:14.710 --> 00:11:18.580
find in a local platform, users
can get more out of their day

00:11:18.580 --> 00:11:22.120
because it is simplified
and centralized,

00:11:22.120 --> 00:11:27.430
resulting in a 63% lower
administration cost overall.

00:11:27.430 --> 00:11:29.620
Then for the end
user, the platform

00:11:29.620 --> 00:11:32.480
means secure application access.

00:11:32.480 --> 00:11:36.340
Whether it's a SaaS app,
virtual desktop environment,

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:38.110
or a favorite
Android application

00:11:38.110 --> 00:11:40.570
available through Google
Play for Enterprise,

00:11:40.570 --> 00:11:42.347
users have access
to all of their data

00:11:42.347 --> 00:11:44.680
right from the Chrome launcher
in the bottom-left corner

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:46.730
of the screen.

00:11:46.730 --> 00:11:49.600
The platform is built
for the cloud worker.

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:51.640
When you deploy Chrome
to your care team,

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:54.430
clinicians become untethered
from local storage

00:11:54.430 --> 00:11:57.790
and are able to enter and
access patient records quickly

00:11:57.790 --> 00:12:00.800
and collaborate with
the extended team.

00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:03.970
And finally, while health care
has a unique set of challenges

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:07.420
to simultaneously
deliver and protect PHI,

00:12:07.420 --> 00:12:10.510
workers still care about having
the state-of-the-art devices

00:12:10.510 --> 00:12:13.240
and cool features
to get the job done.

00:12:13.240 --> 00:12:19.410
With enterprise-grade hardware,
the good news is we have both.

00:12:19.410 --> 00:12:22.720
In health care, security
is a top concern.

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:25.780
Chrome Enterprise extends
comprehensive security

00:12:25.780 --> 00:12:28.200
with a multi-layered approach.

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:31.110
Each Chrome device arrives
encrypted out of the box

00:12:31.110 --> 00:12:34.690
through hardware-backed
security and a TPM chip.

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:37.710
Verified boot of Chrome
OS uses the TPM chip

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:39.490
to ensure integrity
of the device

00:12:39.490 --> 00:12:43.230
and tell if the OS
is genuine or not.

00:12:43.230 --> 00:12:46.560
Tab sandboxing means each
web page in application

00:12:46.560 --> 00:12:49.350
runs in its own restricted
environment, which

00:12:49.350 --> 00:12:53.340
prevents against attacks
such as cross-site scripting.

00:12:53.340 --> 00:12:58.080
When run in ephemeral
mode, browsing information

00:12:58.080 --> 00:13:01.740
is not left behind on the device
because the profile is deleted

00:13:01.740 --> 00:13:04.590
immediately after the last
browser window associated

00:13:04.590 --> 00:13:07.410
with the profile is closed.

00:13:07.410 --> 00:13:09.820
And with AI-driven
threat detection,

00:13:09.820 --> 00:13:15.070
Safe Browsing reports over 1,000
instances of suspected malware

00:13:15.070 --> 00:13:19.180
every minute by showing users
a warning message before they

00:13:19.180 --> 00:13:21.430
visit potentially
dangerous sites

00:13:21.430 --> 00:13:24.240
or download a harmful app.

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:27.830
And, again, with AI-driven
threat detection in Google Play

00:13:27.830 --> 00:13:30.290
Protect, all apps
are automatically

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:35.650
scanned for malware before
and after you install them.

00:13:35.650 --> 00:13:37.210
Then, regular
updates and patches

00:13:37.210 --> 00:13:39.730
round out this
multi-layered approach.

00:13:39.730 --> 00:13:42.460
Chrome OS gets an
